  "finalText": "### Changes Made\n\n1. **CSV End-of-File Termination (`src/csv.mjs`)**: Updated `parseCsv` to call `endRecord()` at EOF when `recordStarted || record.length` is true. This ensures records without a trailing newline (including quoted final fields and trailing empty fields) are committed while avoiding phantom records after a trailing newline.\n2. **Exact Decimal Half-Away-From-Zero Rounding (`src/money.mjs`)**: Replaced `Math.round(Number(text) * 100)` in `parseMoney` with exact `BigInt` integer scaling in ten-thousandths of a major unit (`(units + 50n) / 100n` applied symmetrically with sign), preserving safe-integer validation and avoiding binary floating-point representation drift on half-cents and negative amounts.\n3. **Vendor-Scoped Invoice Identity (`src/dedupe.mjs`)**: Updated `invoiceKey` to return `JSON.stringify([invoice.vendorId, invoice.invoiceId])` instead of `invoice.invoiceId` alone, scoping deduplication, conflict detection, and payment reconciliation collision-safely per supplier.\n\n### Commands Run & Results\n\n1. `node --test test/*.test.mjs` (baseline): 38 passed, 6 failed (`cli.test.mjs`, `csv.test.mjs`, `domain.test.mjs`, `money.test.mjs`, and two in `pipeline.test.mjs`).\n2. `node --test test/*.test.mjs` (after fix): All 44 tests passed (`pass 44, fail 0`).\n3. `node bin/ledger.mjs import data/invoices.csv --payments data/payments.csv --as-of 2026-03-01 --format json`: Exited 0 with all 4 source rows accepted (`1.01`, `10.08`, `-1.01`, `2.00`), `totalCents: 1208`, 3 vendors, 0 conflicts/diagnostics, 3 applied payments (`paidCents: 750`, `outstandingCents: 458`), and 0 unapplied payments.",
